     "title": "Down to Earth: the environmental empathy of Star Trek IV: The Voyage Home at 40",
     "link": "https://letterboxd.com/journal/star-trek-iv-the-voyage-home-at-40/",
     "time": "2026-11-27T04:27:42+13:00",
     "img": "https://a.ltrbxd.com/resized/sm/upload/oo/ts/4g/2k/st1-0-960-0-540-crop-fill.jpg?k=c951125fb6",
     "intro": "As Star Trek IV: The Voyage Home celebrates its 40th anniversary, Payton McCarty-Simas writes in praise of alien probes, humpback whales and the sci-fi franchise’s clarion call for ecological conservation.",
     "category": "Deep Impact"
